* own model: Texas Instruments TLV75530PDQNR, 3.0 V LDO, built only from the maker's datasheet SBVS320D (design/datasheets/motor_tlv755p.pdf, PDF pages). The maker's own unencrypted PSpice model of this part (models/tlv75530p_trans.lib, unchanged, source in models/SOURCES.md) could not be run in ngspice, so this model is used instead.
* ports: IN OUT EN GND   (GND is node 0 in every deck, the port is kept for the pin map)
* params: acc    output accuracy corner, relative (p5: +-1.2 percent, DQN package)
*         rdo    dropout resistance, ohm: dropout voltage / 500 mA. p6 gives VDO 325 mV max at 500 mA for 2.5 V <= VOUT < 3.3 V, -40 to 125 C, so 0.65 ohm (MODEL CHOICE: the sheet gives only the 500 mA point; 250 mV typ = 0.5 ohm)
*         icl    output current limit: 560 mA min, 720 typ, 865 max (p5); default is the minimum
.subckt TLV755P30 in out en gnd params: acc=0 rdo=0.65 icl=0.56
* enable: EN above VHI 1.0 V (p6), UVLO: VIN above 1.3 V typ (p6 VUVLO 1.21 min 1.3 typ 1.44 max)
Bon on 0 V = ( (v(en) > 0.65) && (v(in) > 1.3) ) ? 1 : 0
* start-up time 550 us (p6 tSTR)
Cr ramp 0 0.55m
Bir 0 ramp I = v(on)
Brd ramp 0 I = (1 - v(on)) * v(ramp) / 1
* regulated value 3.0 V (1 + acc), load regulation 0.036 V/A (p5 DQN), dropout rdo, current limit icl with fold back (short circuit limit ISC 355 mA, p5)
Bo x 0 V = min( 3.0*(1+acc)*min(v(ramp),1) - 0.036*max(i(vs),0), max(v(in) - rdo*max(i(vs),0), 0) ) - 5*max(0, i(vs) - icl)
Vs x out 0
* output pull-down RPULLDOWN 120 ohm when disabled (p6)
Bpd out 0 I = (v(on) > 0.5) ? 0 : v(out)/120
* input current = output current + ground current IGND 25 uA typ (p5); 1 uA shutdown current (p5 ISHDN max)
Bin in 0 I = max(i(vs), 0) + ((v(on) > 0.5) ? 25u : 0.1u)
.ends TLV755P30
